# setuptools puts exactly one README in the sdist -- the one named by `readme`
# in pyproject.toml, which is the English file. The Russian translation is a
# peer document, not a generated artifact, and an sdist that omits it is not a
# complete copy of the source. It costs a few kilobytes.
#
# The link between the two READMEs is an absolute GitHub URL and does not break
# without this line; completeness of the source distribution is the whole reason
# it is here.
include README.ru.md
